    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Description</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the unsettling world of <i>Smile, You're Being Filmed: Together</i>, where a dark organization orchestrates a macabre reality show, turning a simple experience into a living nightmare. Dive into the most intense adventure: players take part in a terrifying game where observation, strategy, and survival are essential. Analyze, communicate, and act before it\u2019s too late.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your Mission</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Monitor the environment:</strong> Detect and correct anomalies before they spiral out of control.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stay vigilant:</strong> A killer is lurking, ready to strike at your slightest mistake.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collaborate to survive:</strong> In multiplayer mode, communication and teamwork are your greatest weapons.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by horror and thriller genres, the game immerses you in a gripping universe filled with surprises and mysteries to solve each night.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Exploration and Strategy</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Analyze every corner:</strong> Search the environment for the slightest changes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interact with objects:</strong> Some might hold the key to your survival.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover collectibles:</strong> Hidden secrets that deepen your understanding of the game.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Progressive Difficulty</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each night introduces new gameplay elements, making survival increasingly complex. As you progress, danger intensifies... and the rules of the game evolve.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Can You Tell Reality from Illusion?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your observation skills will be pushed to the limit. With every passing night, challenges grow tougher, and danger draws closer... Will you survive long enough to uncover the truth?</p>",
